<!-- ============ FUNCS(主要機能 3・スクロール表示) ============ -->
<section class="funcs sec-pad" id="funcs">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="cap" data-cap>Features</div>
    <h2 class="funcs-h2" data-reveal>Everything you need to publish, in one place.</h2>
    <div class="funcs-cols">
      <nav class="funcs-nav" aria-label="Feature list">
        <ol>
          <li><a href="#fn-thumbs" class="active"><span class="n">01</span>Instant thumbnails</a></li>
          <li><a href="#fn-search"><span class="n">02</span>Filter & search</a></li>
          <li><a href="#fn-share"><span class="n">03</span>Shared tags & usage terms</a></li>
        </ol>
      </nav>
      <div class="funcs-body">
        <article class="func" id="fn-thumbs">
          <h3 class="func-h">Instant thumbnail browsing</h3>
          <p class="func-b">Even folders with tens of thousands of images open ready to browse. When a folder is first registered, Drive DAM generates thumbnails and copies them locally — that is what keeps browsing fast. Teammates reuse the same thumbnails, so everyone searches and works efficiently.</p>
          <div class="shot" data-shot><img class="shot-pic" src="/drivedam/assets/func-thumbs-en.png" alt="Drive DAM thumbnail view: folder tree on the left, a large thumbnail grid in the center, shortcuts on the right" loading="lazy" width="2556" height="1595"></div>
        </article>
        <article class="func" id="fn-search">
          <h3 class="func-h">Filter and search</h3>
          <p class="func-b">Search and filter by keyword, tag, color, shoot date, usage terms, favorites, and more. File paths are searchable too, so even a folder-name fragment can lead you to the image.<br><span class="func-note">Note: text recognition inside images (OCR) is not supported.</span></p>
          <div class="shot" data-shot><img class="shot-pic" src="/drivedam/assets/func-search-en.png" alt="Filter panel expanded, narrowing the whole library from 9,974 files down to 282 favorites" loading="lazy" width="1872" height="1345"></div>
        </article>
        <article class="func" id="fn-share">
          <h3 class="func-h">Tags, colors, and usage terms — shared with your team</h3>
          <p class="func-b">Tags, notes, and other metadata are available to every member through the shared folder. Usage terms — permission required, do not use, and so on — are shared as well, preventing mistakes before they happen. You can also keep private favorites that stay yours alone.</p>
          <div class="shot" data-shot>
            <div class="shot-panel">
              <img src="/drivedam/assets/func-share1-en.png" alt="Three thumbnails with usage badges — permission required and do not use are visible at a glance" loading="lazy" width="890" height="360" style="left:6%;top:28%;width:57%">
              <img src="/drivedam/assets/func-share2-en.png" alt="Details panel: tags, color, favorite, notes, usage restrictions, plus editor and edit date" loading="lazy" width="547" height="1080" style="right:6%;top:9%;width:25.6%">
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="fmore">
      <div class="cap" data-cap>More features</div>

      <div class="fgroup">
        <h4 class="fgroup-h">Search & viewing</h4>
        <div class="fgrid">
          <div class="fcard w6" data-reveal>
            <div class="fcard-vis nat"><img src="/drivedam/assets/func-files-en.png" alt="A folder where PDFs show their actual first page as a thumbnail, while DOCX, XLSX, and ZIP files show a type icon" loading="lazy" width="2556" height="1595"></div>
            <h4 class="fcard-h">Every file, visible</h4>
            <p class="fcard-b">Images are the main focus, but other files show up with their type, and you can tag and annotate them too. Camera RAW files and PDFs get thumbnails as well.<br><span class="func-note">Note: thumbnails are not generated for videos, Office files, ZIPs, and similar formats.</span></p>
          </div>
          <div class="fcard w6" data-reveal>
            <div class="fcard-vis nat"><img src="/drivedam/assets/func-zoom-en.png" alt="Preview screen showing the original image large, with buttons below: reveal in Explorer, open in default app, download, and 100% view" loading="lazy" width="2556" height="1595"></div>
            <h4 class="fcard-h">Preview at full size</h4>
            <p class="fcard-b">Preview the original large, and zoom to 100% to inspect the details. Arrow keys move you through neighboring files.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="fcard w6" data-reveal>
            <div class="fcard-vis nat"><img src="/drivedam/assets/func-folder-en.png" alt="&quot;Include subfolders&quot; turned on, listing the contents of subfolders together" loading="lazy" width="1999" height="1479"></div>
            <h4 class="fcard-h">Subfolders in one view</h4>
            <p class="fcard-b">Show the contents of subfolders in a single list. See everything at once, without hopping between folders.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="fcard w6" data-reveal>
            <div class="fcard-vis modal" style="aspect-ratio:1999/1479"><img src="/drivedam/assets/func-searchsave-en.png" alt="A saved search being recalled, narrowing to 6 files with three conditions: tag, favorite, and shoot date" loading="lazy" width="1998" height="781"></div>
            <h4 class="fcard-h">Saved searches</h4>
            <p class="fcard-b">Give your go-to filter combinations a name and save them. Recall them anytime from the sidebar.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="fgroup">
        <h4 class="fgroup-h">Export & download</h4>
        <div class="fgrid">
          <div class="fcard" data-reveal>
            <div class="fcard-vis modal"><div class="pshot" style="--src:url('/drivedam/assets/func-zoom-en.png');right:-2%;bottom:5%;width:88%;aspect-ratio:1080/1215;--zoom:250%;--pos:1% 100%" role="img" aria-label="Bottom of the preview screen: buttons for reveal in Explorer, open in default app, download, and 100% view"></div></div>
            <h4 class="fcard-h">Download straight from preview</h4>
            <p class="fcard-b">Download the image you are previewing, on the spot. Reveal it in Explorer or open it in its default app from the same place.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="fcard" data-reveal>
            <div class="fcard-vis modal"><img src="/drivedam/assets/func-export1-en.png" alt="Export dialog: choosing between original size and resize, exporting 12 files at once" loading="lazy" width="945" height="865"></div>
            <h4 class="fcard-h">Export (resize & batch)</h4>
            <p class="fcard-b">Pick the images you need and export them — in bulk, resizing as you go. Choose JPEG, PNG, or WebP for the output. The originals stay exactly as they are.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="fcard" data-reveal>
            <div class="fcard-vis modal"><img src="/drivedam/assets/func-export2-en.png" alt="Crop-and-export dialog with ratio presets and custom ratios" loading="lazy" width="1252" height="1422"></div>
            <h4 class="fcard-h">Export (crop)</h4>
            <p class="fcard-b">Crop to presets like square or social formats — or any ratio you like — resizing in the same pass. JPEG, PNG, and WebP are available here too, and it works on multiple images at once.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="fgroup">
        <h4 class="fgroup-h">Organizing & file operations</h4>
        <p class="fgroup-lead">Tags, colors, and notes are linked to file names. Rename and move files inside Drive DAM and those links stay intact. (Changing files directly in Explorer breaks the link.)</p>
        <div class="fgrid">
          <div class="fcard" data-reveal>
            <div class="fcard-vis modal"><div class="pshot" style="--src:url('/drivedam/assets/func-bulc-en.png');left:15%;top:4%;width:70%;aspect-ratio:553/1114;--zoom:100%;--pos:50% 0" role="img" aria-label="Batch-edit panel with 10 files selected: buttons for view, open, copy, export, batch rename, and a tag-editing dropdown"></div></div>
            <h4 class="fcard-h">Batch editing</h4>
            <p class="fcard-b">Select multiple files and set tags, colors, and usage terms in one go. Batch export starts here too.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="fcard" data-reveal>
            <div class="fcard-vis modal"><img src="/drivedam/assets/func-rename-en.png" alt="Batch rename dialog with tabs for sequential numbers, find & replace, and add before/after, plus a preview list of the new names" loading="lazy" width="978" height="857"></div>
            <h4 class="fcard-h">Batch rename</h4>
            <p class="fcard-b">Rename many files at once — sequential numbers, find & replace, or add before/after. Preview every new name before you commit.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="fcard" data-reveal>
            <div class="fcard-vis modal"><img src="/drivedam/assets/func-move-en.png" alt="Move dialog: choosing a destination from the folder tree; moves are reflected for other members" loading="lazy" width="792" height="928"></div>
            <h4 class="fcard-h">Moving files</h4>
            <p class="fcard-b">Pick a destination in the folder tree and move files in bulk. Moves are reflected for every member.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="fgroup">
        <h4 class="fgroup-h">Working as a team</h4>
        <div class="fgrid">
          <div class="fcard" data-reveal>
            <div class="fcard-vis modal r43"><img src="/drivedam/assets/func-tagmanager-en.png" alt="Tag manager: tags organized into groups such as purpose, subject, and status" loading="lazy" width="1576" height="1121"></div>
            <h4 class="fcard-h">Tag & tag-group management</h4>
            <p class="fcard-b">Manage tags and tag groups in one place. Renames and reorganizing carry over to every member through the shared folder.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="fcard" data-reveal>
            <div class="fcard-vis modal r43"><img src="/drivedam/assets/func-compe-en.png" alt="Conflict resolution dialog comparing your change and a teammate's, choosing which to keep" loading="lazy" width="945" height="533"></div>
            <h4 class="fcard-h">Conflict detection & resolution</h4>
            <p class="fcard-b">If two people edit the same item at the same time, Drive DAM flags the conflict and lets you choose which version to keep. Non-conflicting changes merge automatically — nothing gets overwritten by accident.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="fcard" data-reveal>
            <div class="fcard-vis compose r43">
              <img src="/drivedam/assets/func-safe2-en.png" alt="A list where hidden images appear dimmed, with a view menu toggling &quot;hidden images&quot;" loading="lazy" width="1524" height="705" style="left:6%;top:10%;width:88%">
              <img src="/drivedam/assets/func-safe1-en.png" alt="The &quot;Hide&quot; button — the file itself and its tags remain, and it can be restored anytime" loading="lazy" width="537" height="213" style="left:10%;top:58%;width:52%">
            </div>
            <h4 class="fcard-h">Your original files are never touched</h4>
            <p class="fcard-b">Files in the original image folders cannot be deleted from Drive DAM — reassuring when many people work in the same shared folder.<br><span class="func-note">Note: files you do not need can be hidden from your own view instead.</span></p>
          </div>
          <div class="fcard" data-reveal>
            <div class="fcard-vis modal"><img src="/drivedam/assets/func-rebind-en.png" alt="Relink records dialog listing candidate files for a moved or renamed file, each with a match confidence label" loading="lazy" width="1190" height="1373"></div>
            <h4 class="fcard-h">Relink records</h4>
            <p class="fcard-b">If an image is renamed or moved directly outside Drive DAM, its tags and other records can get left behind in the original folder. Drive DAM detects this automatically, lets you know, and relinks the record to the file's new location.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="fgroup">
        <h4 class="fgroup-h">Appearance</h4>
        <div class="fband" data-reveal>
          <div class="fband-copy">
            <h4 class="fcard-h">Dark mode included</h4>
            <p class="fcard-b">Switch between light and dark with one click — for dim rooms, or for judging image colors on a neutral ground.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="fband-vis">
            <div class="fcard-vis nat"><img src="/drivedam/assets/func-dark-en.png" alt="Drive DAM in dark mode, full screen, with the thumbnail grid in a dark color scheme" loading="lazy" width="2556" height="1595"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ PRICE(コンバージョンエリア) ============ -->
